{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"94138","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/94138","key":"MC-1310","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"30/Oct/12 6:35 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Dispensed boats and rafts get stuck inside of dispensers used to place them.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build the setup as shown in the attachment below. <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/122978\" title=\"setup.png attached to MC-1310\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"setup.png\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"0240bc57-9506-4a41-88b3-1a850aeaf140\" rel=\"noreferrer\">setup.png<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span></li>\n\t<li>Place a boat inside the dispenser.</li>\n\t<li>Enable entity hitboxes by pressing \"F3 + B\".</li>\n\t<li>Use the lever to activate the dispenser.</li>\n\t<li>Look closely at where the boat comes in contact with the dispenser.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not dispensed boats and rafts get stuck inside of dispensers used to place them.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Dispensed boats and rafts get stuck inside of dispensers used to place them.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Dispensed boats and rafts would not get stuck inside of dispensers used to place them. They should be dispensed a bit more forward in order to avoid this issue from occurring.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"24/Oct/14 5:47 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/122972","id":"122972","filename":"2013-07-14_15.54.04.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"kumasasa","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"customer"},"created":"14/Jul/13 6:55 AM","size":"305 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/122972","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/122972"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/122973","id":"122973","filename":"2018-09-29_23.21.11.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png"},"displayName":"migrated","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"29